        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, hard coal, at cogen, allocation exergy</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, hard coal, at cogen, allocation exergy
The average allocated fuel input per heat output is about 0.83 MJ/MJ. The heat supply of this technology in the region is at about 240 PJ based on Eurostat/IEA. NA; UUID: 35f42c49-da31-35ad-a207-0014d7f61e68
Heat output at the plant gate. The dataset uses the average net efficiency of power plants in the region adjusted for co-generation (using allocation based on exergy content). 
Location: ENTSO-E in 2019
Technology: Average installed technology.
Time period: 
Production volume: 240 PJ
Sampling: Databases/ literature data based on regional statistics.
Extrapolations: No relevant extrapolations.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_35f42c49-da31-35ad-a207-0014d7f61e68.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
